  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Minor in Retail and Services Management"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Minors",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Minors",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/minors/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The Retail and Services Management Minor delivers the fundamentals necessary for understanding the core elements of the retail business. The Minor will also help students gain an understanding of the fundamental importance of managing customer relations and customer satisfaction in an increasingly competitive retail environment."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The core courses include courses in retail consumer insight, service quality management, visual merchandising and planning, retail logistics, and retail buying process. Other courses allow the student to increase their knowledge of areas such as franchising, design, commerce and culture, international retail markets, relationship marketing, advanced buying process and multi-channel retailing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Administered by: Ted Rogers School of Retail Management"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Exclusions: This minor is not available to students in the following programs:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Retail Management",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Retail Management",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/programs/trsm/retail/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "To receive this Minor, students must complete six (6) courses from the following curriculum:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Required course (1):"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "RMG 200 Introduction to Retail",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "RMG 200",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/retail-management/RMG/200/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Plus a minimum of two (2) to a maximum of three (3) courses from the following:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "RMG 302 Retail Consumer Insight or MKT 400 Understanding Consumers",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "RMG 302",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/retail-management/RMG/302/"
        },
        {
          "text": "MKT 400",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/marketing/MKT/400/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "RMG 303 Managing the Retail Workplace or HTT 100 * Tourism Experiences Management",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "RMG 303",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/retail-management/RMG/303/"
        },
        {
          "text": "HTT 100",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/hospitality-and-tourism-management/HTT/100/"
        }
      ]
    },
